The '''Cave Island''' is a tiny island in the [[Second Sea]]. It has three [[chests]]: a [[Chests|silver]] (on one side of the large main cave), a [[Chests|gold]] (on the grassy top), and a [[Chests|diamond]] (behind a partial wall in the upper room). 

==Location==
This Cave Island is located in a remote area in the [[Second Sea]], to the east of [[Kingdom of Rose]]'s docks.
<gallery>
File:Cave island location in second sea.png|Location of Cave Island in the [[Second Sea]].
</gallery>

==Upper Cave==
The Cave Island has a hidden upper room which is accessed through a small square opening in the ceiling (look carefully near a wall). This upper room is one of the five spawn locations for the [[Flowers|blue flower]] found on one side of the mint-green grassy carpet. The blue flower will only be spawned at night. There is also a [[Chests|Diamond chest]] concealed behind a partial wall.

<gallery>
File:Upper Cave Entrance 2.png|Entrance into the upper cave portion.
</gallery>

==Facts==
* The Cave Island does not have an official name.
* It is not accessible from [[Portal]]'s World Warp ability. 
* There used to be a [[Poneglyphs|Poneglyph]] on Cave Island, but it was later removed in [[Updates/13|Update 13]].
* The Cave Island does not have its own [[Soundtracks|background music]], but the [[Water|sea]] [[Soundtracks|background music]] plays instead. 
* Like the [[Remote Island]] and [[Jean-Luc Island]], The Cave Island is not really considered an island and using a [[Miracle]] onto this island will not make the boat land onto the sea. therefore, The player can drive the boat into the cave island, and land it in the island's ground. 
* This makes the cave island an ideal area for sea event hunting, as the player can walk on the cave island's floor and [[Shark]]<nowiki/>s and [[Piranha]]<nowiki/>s can't get inside the island, thus preserving the boat's health and allowing Players with other [[Races]] to kill the sea events freely. But the player should be aware that [[Ship Raid]] cannons can pass though the walls and hit the player's boat 

